Switchboard for Android bundles these fonts, each under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. The full license texts are in licenses/.

  Mulish         app/src/main/res/font/mulish.ttf          licenses/OFL-mulish.txt
  Nunito Sans    app/src/main/res/font/nunito_sans.ttf     licenses/OFL-nunito-sans.txt
  JetBrains Mono app/src/main/res/font/jetbrains_mono.ttf  licenses/OFL-jetbrains-mono.txt

The files are the variable fonts from https://github.com/google/fonts (ofl/).

The session terminal runs xterm.js, bundled unmodified under the MIT License.
The full license texts are in licenses/.

  @xterm/xterm 6.0.0       app/src/main/assets/terminal/xterm.js, xterm.css  licenses/MIT-xterm.txt
  @xterm/addon-fit 0.11.0  app/src/main/assets/terminal/addon-fit.js         licenses/MIT-xterm-addon-fit.txt

The versions are the ones the desktop app uses (package-lock.json); the files are lib/ and css/ from the
npm packages.
